; A small dimensional-analysis document.
;
; Grammar:
;   title "..."                       an optional title for the report
;   tolerance NUMBER                  relative tolerance for checks
;   unit NAME = SCALE EXPRESSION      define a unit
;   convert VALUE UNIT to UNIT        convert between compatible units
;   check VALUE UNIT = VALUE UNIT     assert two quantities agree
;
; Blank lines and lines starting with # or ; are ignored.
; Unit expressions are products and quotients with integer exponents.
; Only multiplicative units are supported; temperatures use kelvin.

title "Beam check"

unit furlong = 201.168 m
unit fortnight = 14 day

convert 5 km to m
convert 100 km/h to m/s
convert 1 mi to km
convert 1 L to m^3
convert 1 furlong to m
convert 1 fortnight to day

check 1 N = 1 kg*m/s^2
check 1 J = 1 N*m
check 1 W = 1 J/s
check 1 Pa = 1 N/m^2
